ses to argue that Israel's civilian casualty figures compared favourably with other wars.\n\nSami couldn't believe what he was hearing: “Listen to him. 73,000 is just 73,000.”\n\nJoseph argued that civilian deaths were tragic but unavoidable in a war against Hamas.\n\nSami's response was devastatingly simple: “Joseph, don't do it to the kids.”\n\nHe reminded Joseph of the Holocaust, of the persecution Jewish people endured, and of the moral responsibility not to inflict suffering on another population.\n\nAnd that leaves us with the question at the centre of this entire confrontation:\n\nWhen does defending your people's right to survive become an argument for the suffering of another people?\n\nAnd who gets to draw that line?\n\n@SALHACHIMI, @israel_advocacy"},"possibly_sensitive":false,"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":40201,"like_count":183,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":24},"text":"🇮🇱🇵🇸 73,000 dead in Gaza, and Israeli advocate Joseph Cohen thinks that number isn't as bad as it looks\n\nThis is where my debate between Sami Hamdi and Joseph went completely off the rails.\n\nJoseph insists Israel isn't pursuing territorial expansion. He says Israelis are fighting https://t.co/WxVgmKkRcw","url":"https://x.com/MarioNawfal/status/2110452934056001658"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110452785741266945"]},"author_id":"1603997064626479104","conversation_id":"2110452802946244643","created_at":"2026-10-14T19:28:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110452802946244643"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/XhRlfulAbb","end":65,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/crazyclipsonly/status/2110452802946244643/video/1","media_key":"13_2110452785741266945","start":42,"url":"https://t.co/XhRlfulAbb"}]},"id":"2110452802946244643","lang":"en","possibly_sensitive":false,"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":10271,"like_count":36,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"That's one way to learn how to whe